  "prefLabel": "Ins 4201.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4201.01 Purpose and Scope. This chapter contains the provisions for submission of data on all encounters for health care by uninsured patients from hospitals, community health centers, and hospital owned or controlled physician practices and other providers.\n\nSource. #9806, eff 11-1-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4200.html"
